will happen in real life.<br /> <br /> All and any comments are appreciated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (Especially if you send me a PM with a desire to check out my plan and see if you can poke any holes in it). Cheers.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> EDIT:<br /> Finally received the last player. We're preparing for the game. Player characters / prelude and the game itself will be available here: <a href=\"http://www.evernote.com/shard/s263/sh/a1344046-fa4a-4e43-b246-b30af35a7f4a/20faeb894212ea792e2bfd86800844f9\" target=\"_blank\">LINK</a>. Leaving the original test in spoiler tags. Comments are more than welcome <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":294,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","user":"Griautis","date":". 05-26-2014, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T12:57:43-07:00","id":185001,"title":"","content":"First session played:<a href=\"https://demonic-hartford.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\"> \u200bhttps://demonic-hartford.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log<